sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Dev as Developer
  participant CI as GitLab CI
  participant BE as Sentinel backend
  participant Duo as GitLab Duo flow
  participant Gate as Gate jobs
  Dev->>CI: push (faulty commit)
  CI->>CI: start candidate + stable, send real requests
  CI->>BE: evaluator.verdict FAIL (16.67% errors)
  Note over BE: DETECTED
  CI->>CI: stop candidate, probe stable 15x
  CI->>BE: rollback.completed (probe ok)
  Note over BE: ROLLED_BACK
  CI->>BE: evidence.collected (SHA-256)
  Note over BE: EVIDENCE_COLLECTED
  CI-->>Duo: pipeline failed trigger
  Duo->>Duo: read evidence bundle + source
  Duo->>CI: branch duo/fix/inc-…, MR with fix + test
  CI-->>BE: MR webhook
  Note over BE: REPAIR_PROPOSED
  CI->>Gate: MR pipeline
  Gate->>Gate: test fails on broken, passes on fix
  Gate->>Gate: Integrity Gate (no weakened tests)
  Gate->>BE: regression_proof + integrity verdicts
  Note over BE: VERIFYING
  Dev->>CI: merge (gates green)
  CI-->>BE: merge webhook
  Note over BE: MERGED
  CI->>BE: deploy.canary_started (merge commit)
  CI->>BE: evaluator.verdict PASS at 100%
  Note over BE: RECOVERED
